low"},{"name":"allow_for_smooth","value":"Open Setting and Give Manual Permission For Access Location and Camera For Better and Fast Response"},{"name":"allow_for_smooth_1","value":"Open Setting and Give Manual Permission For Access Location, Storage and Camera For Better and Fast Response"},{"name":"allow_for_smooth_audio","value":"Open Setting and give manual permission for Record Audio for record video sound"},{"name":"allow_permissions","value":"Allow Permissions"},{"name":"altitude","value":"Altitude"},{"name":"amazon","value":"Amazon"},{"name":"androidx_startup","value":"androidx.startup"},{"name":"ans_1_pre_desc","value":"- The Manual Location feature allows users to edit and customize the location details stamped on their photos. This feature is particularly useful for adding personalized addresses to photos taken for events, business purposes, or creative projects."},{"name":"ans_1_pre_desc_1","value":"✦ How to use the Manual Location feature?"},{"name":"ans_1_que_1","value":"✦ What does “In Range” Manual Location mean?"},{"name":"ans_1_que_1_ans","value":"- “In Range” means you’ve added a Manual Location with a specific range (like 100m), and your current location is inside that range."},{"name":"ans_1_que_2","value":"✦ What is an \\\"Out of Range\\\" Manual Location?"},{"name":"ans_1_que_2_ans","value":"- \\\"Out of Range\\\" means you’ve added Manual Locations, but your current location is not inside the range of any of added manual location. Since your current location is outside the range of all Manual Locations, you cannot use them on your photos until you move closer to one of those locations."},{"name":"ans_1_que_3","value":"\"✦ Why can't I select an Out of Range Manual Location?\""},{"name":"ans_1_que_3_ans","value":"\"- You cannot select an Out of Range Manual Location because your current location is outside the range you set for manual locations. Once you're inside the range, you’ll be able to select and use that Manual Location on your photos.\""},{"name":"ans_1_que_4","value":"✦ What is the purpose of setting a range for Manual Locations?"},{"name":"ans_1_que_4_ans","value":"- The range ensures that you are physically inside the location range you set. This keeps your photos authentic by making sure the address stamped on the photo matches where you are. You need to be within the specified range (for example, 100m) to use the Manual Location."},{"name":"ans_1_que_5","value":"✦ How does the Manual Location feature improve photo authenticity?"},{"name":"ans_1_que_5_ans","value":"- By requiring you to be physically within range of the location you set, the feature ensures that the address stamped on your photos is accurate and can’t be manipulated. This adds authenticity and trustworthiness to your work photos, as the location data is real."},{"name":"ans_1_que_6","value":"✦ Why can’t I change the short address (City, State, Country) in Manual Locations?"},{"name":"ans_1_que_6_ans","value":"- To maintain location accuracy, the short address (City, State, Country) cannot be changed. This ensures the photo’s location is real and prevents from stamping photos with false or incorrect city or country information."},{"name":"ans_1_que_7","value":"✦ Can I use Manual Locations without visiting the actual place?"},{"name":"ans_1_que_7_ans","value":"- No, you must visit the actual place and be within the range you set to use a Manual Location. This ensures that the address stamped on your photos reflects the real location where the photo was taken."},{"name":"ans_1_que_8","value":"✦ Can I add a Manual Location for a different place while I’m at my current location?"},{"name":"ans_1_que_8_ans","value":"\"- Yes, you can add a Manual Location for another place while you’re at your current location. However, you will only be able to use that Manual Location when you are physically near that place and within the range you set. If you are not in the range of that location, you won't be able to use it to stamp photos.\""},{"name":"ans_1_step_1_desc","value":"- Find + and tap to add the Manual Location."},{"name":"ans_1_step_4_desc","value":"- Choose a radius for the range (for example, 100m). This means you have to be within that distance from the location to use it."},{"name":"ans_1_step_5","value":"Edit the location \\\"Line 1\\\""},{"name":"ans_1_step_5_desc","value":"- You can change the detailed address."},{"name":"ans_1_step_6_desc_1","value":"- After filling in the details, tap \\\"✔\\\"."},{"name":"ans_1_step_6_desc_2","value":"- Your manual location is now added!"},{"name":"ans_1_step_7_desc","value":"- You can see and use the Manual Location feature when you are physically in range of the manually added locations."},{"name":"answer_1_desc_11","value":"Set a Range"},{"name":"answer_1_desc_3","value":"Add Manual Location"},{"name":"answer_1_desc_4","value":"Set a title for the Manual Location"},{"name":"answer_1_desc_6","value":"- Give the location a name. This can be anything you like to help you remember it."},{"name":"app_error_report","value":"Error Report"},{"name":"app_name","value":"GPS Map Camera"},{"name":"app_recipient","value":"support@gpsmapcamera.com"},{"name":"app_theme","value":"App Theme"},{"name":"appbar_scrolling_view_behavior","value":"com.google.android.material.appbar.AppBarLayout$ScrollingViewBehavior"},{"name":"apply","value":"Apply"},{"name":"april","value":"April"},{"name":"aqilevel","value":"AQI"},{"name":"are_you_enjoy_app","value":"\"Here's whats you get\""},{"name":"are_you_sure_you_want_to_delete_this_item","value":"Are you sure you want to delete?"},{"name":"ascending","value":"Ascending"},{"name":"atleast_one_location","value":"Add at least 1 location."},{"name":"audrey","value":"Audrey"},{"name":"auto_save","value":"Auto-save photos to"},{"name":"azimuth","value":"Azimuth/Bearing"},{"name":"background_color","value":"Background Color"},{"name":"bef_aft_report_title","value":"Before / After Report"},{"name":"before","value":"Before"},{"name":"be